      "author": "dpunkz09",
      "content": "It's a marketing preview, not hands-on impressions. Everything here is curated, cut, and paced by Rockstar's trailer team — smooth traversal, dramatic music, best-angle car chases. None of that tells you how the game actually feels with a controller in your hands, how the AI reacts under player-driven chaos, or how repetitive the side activities get after hour twelve.",
